+ * @returns A function that produces a sequence of indices.
+ * @example <caption>Always increasing</caption>
+ *
+ * ```js
+ * const gen = nthCheck.sequence('2n+3')
+ *
+ * gen() // `1`
+ * gen() // `3`
+ * gen() // `5`
+ * gen() // `8`
+ * gen() // `11`
+ * ```
+ *
+ * @example <caption>With end value</caption>
+ *
+ * ```js
+ *
+ * const gen = nthCheck.sequence('-2n+5');
+ *
+ * gen() // 0
+ * gen() // 2
+ * gen() // 4
+ * gen() // null
