+([disclosure](https://nodesecurity.io/advisories/68)) and
+`ws` ([disclosure](https://nodesecurity.io/advisories/67)) were discovered by
+[Mathias Buus](https://github.com/mafintosh) and
+[Feross Aboukhadijeh](http://feross.org/).
