+
+* Long#**getHighBitsUnsigned**(): `number`<br />
+  Gets the high 32 bits as an unsigned integer.
+
+* Long#**getLowBits**(): `number`<br />
+  Gets the low 32 bits as a signed integer.
+
+* Long#**getLowBitsUnsigned**(): `number`<br />
